                                        "sense_id": "b43ad6f9-3249-3966-8ac4-b82ff2de291b",
                                        "entry_id": "af3087bc-c2d4-3e8f-b14d-618368b59266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A syringe-like device for administering medicinal pills to animals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4af8cd3a-b414-3bc2-9ba2-e6b15f59b8d2",
                                        "entry_id": "af3087bc-c2d4-3e8f-b14d-618368b59266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who enjoys or frequently takes medication in pill form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68db8a9e-ce1f-44c7-9f68-208a425abfe8",
                                                "sense_id": "4af8cd3a-b414-3bc2-9ba2-e6b15f59b8d2",
                                                "text": "Well, you know, once Pop got into his sixties, he came to be a bit of a pill popper, what with the blood pressure and the blood sugar and the cholesterol and the arthritis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66ce1d60-7fd2-35f2-a4e4-97e650dc3434",
                                        "entry_id": "af3087bc-c2d4-3e8f-b14d-618368b59266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who frequently takes any other kind of pill, such as vitamins or illicit drugs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e90f491-320e-40a4-81fc-169e069eb817",
                                                "sense_id": "66ce1d60-7fd2-35f2-a4e4-97e650dc3434",
                                                "text": "It's great when people are enthusiastic about health and wellness, but you just have to watch out for how hard the vitamin people sell you on the pricey supplements — they'll try to turn you into a pill popper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34e168c2-2ccd-478f-8385-bb0d53cf9311",
                                                "sense_id": "66ce1d60-7fd2-35f2-a4e4-97e650dc3434",
                                                "text": "In addition to using methamphetamine, most of the women JJ encountered were pill-poppers—Xanax, Ecstasy, Somas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4aea1fd0-0bdf-3087-813c-8cf62b951a00",
                                        "entry_id": "af3087bc-c2d4-3e8f-b14d-618368b59266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who frequently takes any other kind of pill, such as vitamins or illicit drugs.",
                                            "Especially, someone with a frank substance use disorder who consumes a large amount of illicit pills, especially opioid street drug pills: synonym of pillhead."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "819ddeb2-c8d5-4caa-87da-e44299daf6ff",
                                                "sense_id": "4aea1fd0-0bdf-3087-813c-8cf62b951a00",
                                                "text": "I wouldn't hang around in that part of town after dark, what with all the methheads and pill poppers. I'm not looking to get robbed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
